      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get that, but \"extremist\" or \"radical\" can be pretty subjective depending on who you ask in the region. be more specific though. if i'm in a place like Georgia or Azerbaijan, are there specific movements or parties that the international community basically agrees are the \"safe/moderate\" ones to deal with, versus the ones that are seen as disruptive or extremist? i want to know who the \"reasonable\" actors are.",
